    "leafAcceptanceNotDischarged": [
        "NOT DISCHARGED: 'simulated' in the sense the leaf's tool column names — a coarse-grained/MD (oxDNA/Martini) ensemble. This is an analytic multi-mode equipartition result, exact within its model.",
        "NOT DISCHARGED: a 95% confidence interval. A CI on an exact analytic result is a category error; the bracket above is a MODEL range, not a sampling interval, and must not be reported as one.",
        "NOT DISCHARGED: the lateral (in-plane) mode, which the layer does not confine at all — see the lateral block. It is bounded by the anchoring scheme, which §3 does not specify.",
        "NOT ADDRESSED: the lever itself. The leaf says 'lever positional variance'; this task produces the TILE's, and C-0006 shows the two differ by the local dishing wherever the coupling is not effectively continuous."
